    {
      "name": "Vomit Worms",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The statue disgorges a Bore Worm Swarm into an adjacent 10-foot-by-10-foot space. Creatures in the swarm's area are immediately affected by the bore worm swarm's Swarming Bites, after which the bore worm swarm rolls initiative and acts independently before disappearing after 1d6 minutes.</p>",
